      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Just some quick sharing on efficiency of having high hit% \n\nBefore adjustment \n\n1. My monster cards was 25/20/10 (atk guard def) \n\nWas able to clear till dojo 483 only with Hit rate of 178.5% only but.. after adjustment.. \n\n2. Adjusted \n- monster cards was 20/20/20 (atk/guard/def, one def card was still 15 \n- hit rate 220%\n- cleared dojo up to 503\n\nBoth comparison used the same pets \n\nSeruf, Eliza, Viking, goby, android, skull commander and dark goo",
