    {
      "id": "1161858035816337428",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2023-10-11T22:49:02.017-04:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2023-10-11T22:49:11.497-04:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "**__Stuff that affect initial rage__**\nAdd self initial rage (max +11)\n- Pet (seruf) up to +3 at +9\n- Wings (exo) +1 at +3\n- Wings (green) +1 at +3\n- Wings (flower) +1 at +5\n- Wings (upcoming thorns) +1 at +3\n- Wings (upcoming feathers) +1 at +3\n- Stigma (prom) +1 at +3\n- Stigma (vampire) up to +2 at +5\n\nReduce enemy initial rage (max -8)\n- Wings (glory) -1 at +7\n- Wings (green) -1 at +5\n- Wings (flower) -1 at +3\n- Wings (upcoming thorns) -1 at +5\n- Wings (upcoming feathers) -1 at +5\n- Stigma (prom) up to -2 at +5\n- Stigma (vampire) -1 at +3\n\n**__Stuff that affect rage gain__**\nAdd self rage\n- Pet (viking) +1 on auto 4\n- Pet (cornian) +1 on auto 4 (& allies)\n- Pet (birk) +3 every 20s\n\nReduce reduction of self rage\n- Pet (eliza) up to -3 at +13\n\nReduce enemy rage\n- Pet (brexton) -1 on auto 3\n\nCredits to @boom",
